la glis. cusku di'e:
> Right.  So if I can say  mi du la glis.  then why can't I say  mi la glis. ?

Because it's ungrammatical.  Lojban is a language, not just a notation
scheme, and "la" introduces a sumti.  However, you can say "mi me la glis."
Elegance bows to convenience; most of the time, you want to use a name
as a sumti, not as a predicate.

